      "translations": {
        "en": "Ahmad ibn Muhammad ibn Isa from Muhammad ibn Sulayman from al-Husayn ibn Umar who said: I said to Abu Abdillah (peace be upon him), 'A man bequeathed to me something in the way of God,' so he said, 'Expend it in Hajj.' I said to him, 'He bequeathed it to me in the way of God,' so he said, 'Expend it in Hajj.' I said to him, 'He bequeathed it to me in the way of God,' so he said, 'I know nothing of his way that is superior to Hajj.'"
